        <h3>I build small, fast things for the web.</h3>
        <p>That usually means fewer features, lighter pages and a lot of small decisions nobody notices. I work across design and code, and I care most about the part where the two meet: spacing, type, loading states, the words on a button.</p>
        <p>This site is where I keep the work, the writing and a few experiments.</p>
