        <h3>Content first</h3>
        <p>I start from the real words and data, not from boxes. A layout built around placeholder text usually breaks the day the real text arrives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile span-2 fill-kw">
        <h3>Less, but finished</h3>
        <p>I would rather ship three things that work everywhere than ten that work on my laptop. Cutting scope is a design tool.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile span-2 fill-fn">
        <h3>Speed is a feature</h3>
        <p>People notice a slow page before they notice anything else about it. I set a size budget early and keep to it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
